skipper 33105~
the Skipper~
The Skipper stands here with a clipboard in one hand.
~
The Skipper is the only soul in Abenos who isn't hated by Captain Harcastle.
They sailed together on many a voyage, and when the time came for the
Captain to retire, the Skipper decided he'd had enough of the ocean life.
