zepheba clockmaker 33111~
Zepheba~
Zepheba the Clockmaker is here.
~
Zepheba is an elven refugee from the Everwar battles.  He abandoned his
forest during a series of ogre raids, and took up residence here, in the
only human city not plagued by violence.  He remains true to his elven
heritage by being a master at his craft, being well known as the finest
clockmaker in the land.  He is dressed neatly in matching trousers and a
waistcoat, with a fine laced silk shirt setting off the outfit.  A golden
watch on a chain sits in his pocket just beneath his lapels.
~
