lileki 33112~
Lileki~
Lileki stands here, tending to her shop.
~
Lileki is a cheerful woman in her late thirties.  She has tended the gift
shop in Abenos for over twenty years now, and still enjoys seeing new faces
come in with stories from foreign parts.  She wears the standard Abenos
clothing, a light cotton dress gathered at the waist.  Around her shoulders,
a light woolen scarf keeps her warm against the sea breeze that blows in
from the docks.
~
