H M 0~
ishexido mage 33113~
Ishexido~
Ishexido the Mage exudes a sense of power.
~
Ishexido was born in Abenos many years ago, but a wandering mage noticed a
talent in him at a very early age.  He was sent off to the High Tower of
Sorcery in Wayreth to learn the secret arts, and though he never rose high
he maintains a pride in his guild.  As an accomplished mage, he returned to
Abenos to distribute magical items to his townsfolk.  He also serves as an
advisor to the castle on the council of mages when needed, as he is the only
local mage.  He wears a rich red robe, with a deep hood covering his face
with shadows.
~
