elf christmas m33180~
the christmas elf~
A christmas elf rushes around you.
~
Elves, as a race, are generally quite beautiful.  And, as with all rules,
there are exceptions.  This elf is one of them.  He stands four feet tall,
with a nose perfectly in proportion to a six feet tall body.  His face, far
from being flawlessly elegant, could best be described as 'homely.'  But
set above the oversized nose, in the middle of the plain face, are two of
the merriest eyes that ever graced a face, and in the shadow of his nose,
his lips are curved up into a wide and friendly smile.
~
